{"4671590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Call of Elmore", "steam_appid": 4671590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Wake up, and become the hero in...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671590/extras/698bc7453e88c1e5c2e91967a908aa39.avif?t=1780024828\" width=960 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671590/extras/d252358ff975caf482e40f04412b2798.gif?t=1780024828\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671590/extras/d252358ff975caf482e40f04412b2798.poster.avif?t=1780024828\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an open overworld where it's up to you to figure out which places to visit and piece the crisis together until you're able to tackle the root of the problem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The top-down open world and random encounters take the player into action-packed sidescrolling scenes, where you'll have to use your wit, reflexes, and ingenuity to quickly get your bearings, defeat the enemies in your way, and get the rewards at the end of each gauntlet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Certain items and tools will prove crucial to your progression. Scour the land to get an upper-hand in dealing with the crisis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you ever find yourself at a dead-end, explore more! A new key, ability, or item in another place might be just what you need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671590/extras/5992853ea193e51affacd18f19c88798.gif?t=1780024828\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671590/extras/5992853ea193e51affacd18f19c88798.poster.avif?t=1780024828\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mission is dire, but you need not worry! Alter the gameplay through SKULLS, individual gameplay modifiers that change the way you play - and your score. Make the game easier through boosts like extra health and damage, make it harder through invisibility and weaker weapon reach, or make the game weird through...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671590/extras/95d1aef50ba2e6e332d64ab0548ae8f1.gif?t=1780024828\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671590/extras/95d1aef50ba2e6e332d64ab0548ae8f1.poster.avif?t=1780024828\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the game in a completely new way! The first unlockable SKULL in the game is the Randomizer. Shuffle all inventory equipment, most keys, all upgrades, and more! No two runs will be quite the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Awaiting you in Call of Elmore...</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>100 Screens</strong>, and a <strong>dozen random encounters</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Items and abilities</strong> are more than puzzle tools, <strong>combo them</strong> in battle!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>dozen skulls</strong> that change the way you play!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nearly <strong>30 unique enemies</strong>, some of which are based on New England folklore!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of little secrets!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique scoring system that stays out of the way of casual players!</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Wake up, and become the hero in...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671590/extras/698bc7453e88c1e5c2e91967a908aa39.avif?t=1780024828\" width=960 height=300 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671590/extras/d252358ff975caf482e40f04412b2798.gif?t=1780024828\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671590/extras/d252358ff975caf482e40f04412b2798.poster.avif?t=1780024828\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an open overworld where it's up to you to figure out which places to visit and piece the crisis together until you're able to tackle the root of the problem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The top-down open world and random encounters take the player into action-packed sidescrolling scenes, where you'll have to use your wit, reflexes, and ingenuity to quickly get your bearings, defeat the enemies in your way, and get the rewards at the end of each gauntlet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Certain items and tools will prove crucial to your progression. Scour the land to get an upper-hand in dealing with the crisis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you ever find yourself at a dead-end, explore more! A new key, ability, or item in another place might be just what you need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671590/extras/5992853ea193e51affacd18f19c88798.gif?t=1780024828\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671590/extras/5992853ea193e51affacd18f19c88798.poster.avif?t=1780024828\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mission is dire, but you need not worry! Alter the gameplay through SKULLS, individual gameplay modifiers that change the way you play - and your score. Make the game easier through boosts like extra health and damage, make it harder through invisibility and weaker weapon reach, or make the game weird through...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671590/extras/95d1aef50ba2e6e332d64ab0548ae8f1.gif?t=1780024828\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671590/extras/95d1aef50ba2e6e332d64ab0548ae8f1.poster.avif?t=1780024828\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the game in a completely new way! The first unlockable SKULL in the game is the Randomizer. Shuffle all inventory equipment, most keys, all upgrades, and more! No two runs will be quite the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Awaiting you in Call of Elmore...</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>100 Screens</strong>, and a <strong>dozen random encounters</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Items and abilities</strong> are more than puzzle tools, <strong>combo them</strong> in battle!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>dozen skulls</strong> that change the way you play!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nearly <strong>30 unique enemies</strong>, some of which are based on New England folklore!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of little secrets!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique scoring system that stays out of the way of casual players!</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Call of Elmore is an experimental arcade-styled action-adventure game with a unique blend of top-down and sidescrolling gameplay. Acquire a larger arsenal, explore the region, and survive while figuring out how a simple Lighthouse flame has laid waste to the colony.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671590/8ffe61d2149431aa84efc837fa7ef08feb679894/header.jpg?t=1780024828", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671590/f85c3c10723cd406cd5b5392edaedd051d6eb62f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780024828", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4671590/f85c3c10723cd406cd5b5392edaedd051d6eb62f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780024828", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 512MB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad Core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["Broadwood Studio"],